WEBVTT

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.238
Good for you, Chris.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.973
I hear you were able to
have a meal.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:10.143
Yes. I feel good today.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.078
Good. I'm sure you'll get better.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.417
Words can be so useful.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.111
Huh?

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:22.148
It allows you to speak things
that aren't what you really feel.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:26.092
It's times like these that
I don't like my power.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.957
And my power, too?

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.126
You're such a kind girl.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.028
Chris...

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.993
Hey, you're thinking
about that girl again.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.405
I'll sleep for a while.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.378
I'm getting sleepy.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.539
Chris...?

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.351
Chris?

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.750
Come on, Chris!

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:54.020
Now, a miracle is about
to be created upon this planet.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.889
Now, a miracle is about
to be created upon this planet.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.880
Now, a miracle is about
to be created upon this planet.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.469
What?! What are you doing?!

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.732
What're you doing?

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.270
What're you trying to do?

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.984
Hey.
What size are you?

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:27.782
Uh, how rude...

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:29.055
No, you fool.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.790
Your finger. Your finger.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.759
What's your finger size?

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.194
Why do you want to know, silly?

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:37.960
You don't have any reason
to ask me that at all.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.696
I do.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.571
It's so I can buy a ring.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.482
What a bad dream.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:06.025
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.460
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.394
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:15.398
Episode 7: The Invisible Words

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:28.314
Pulse is down to 42!

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.805
Administer 13 milligrams
of Prifonin.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.153
How sad.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:37.257
Even one with TI abilities
to resonate with the Earth...

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.088
...still can't beat an illness.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:43.594
Let's at least reduce the
amount he has to suffer.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.533
You probably figure a TI...

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:49.402
...is supposed to suffer like this
anyway.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:49.936
What?!

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:50.960
Cindy.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.413
Ju... na...

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:02.973
Did Chris say something
just now?

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.252
Just a name.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.453
Whose?

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.148
Mine, of course!

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:10.356
I see.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.620
He must be thinking about you.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:42.079
Why don't we meet at Moto-Koh
later on? Sayuri

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:22.729
You're really acting strange
these days.

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:23.796
You think?

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:26.132
You'll suddenly stop
walking...

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:28.032
...you'll cry while
watching the rain...

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.338
...and you stopped going
to Meriken Burger...

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.738
...where we always went
after the club.

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.506
What are you talking about,
all of a sudden?

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.910
It's not fair to Oshima, you know.

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:46.212
It's fine for you.
You can do whatever you want.

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:51.415
But maybe you're taking
advantage of Oshima's kindness.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:57.630
Oshima was lamenting to me
that he doesn't understand...

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.996
...what's going on
with you anymore.

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:11.244
D-Don't get me wrong.

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.246
There's nothing going on
between me and Oshima.

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:14.804
We're just friends.

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:18.885
I bet he asked for your ring size.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:19.715
What?

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:23.386
Oshima told you about that?

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:27.316
You should've just said so,
in the first...

00:05:30.063 --> 00:05:30.927
Juna!

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:34.792
Darn!

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.161
Hey!

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:40.865
Juna!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.232
Idiot...

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:51.017
Hey...

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:54.885
Did you have a fight with Sayuri?

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.417
No.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.414
That's fine, but...

00:06:00.126 --> 00:06:05.393
I heard that you and Sayuri
went to Moto-Koh, so...

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.230
Sayuri, Sayuri, huh?

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:11.471
Huh? What?

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:12.802
Nothing.

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:18.371
Hey, how about we sit down
and take a little break?

00:06:25.518 --> 00:06:28.578
What's he all jittery about?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.219
What's he thinking?

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:35.856
What's on his mind?

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:57.083
Huh? What?

00:06:57.083 --> 00:06:57.884
What are these words?

00:06:57.884 --> 00:07:00.753
When should I do it?
I've got to do it.
Ring Juna

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:01.754
Don't tell me...

00:07:01.754 --> 00:07:04.416
These are Tokio's...

00:07:18.171 --> 00:07:19.536
No!

00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:21.607
You all right?

00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:22.733
You've got this blank look.

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:37.256
Nothing to worry about!

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:40.123
Appare Genki is a healthy
vitamin drink!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.953
I guess you haven't seen it on TV.

00:07:43.429 --> 00:07:47.099
Nourishment from the fruits
of the land.

00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:50.670
Grown to be tasty, eat me.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:54.440
Apples and oranges,
carrots and parsley...

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.144
Tomatoes and cabbage,
watercress and green pepper...

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:01.511
Appare! Appare!
Appare of the land!

00:08:01.714 --> 00:08:05.518
Another Appare
day for me!

00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:06.951
Second verse!

00:08:07.286 --> 00:08:08.254
Chemicals.
Drugs. Death. Suffering.

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:09.312
Science.
Pesticides.

00:08:12.391 --> 00:08:13.926
What a waste.

00:08:13.926 --> 00:08:16.190
You can't even drink
Appare Genki?

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:17.897
I'm sorry.

00:08:17.897 --> 00:08:22.401
It may be a vitamin drink,
but it's got pesticides in it...

00:08:22.401 --> 00:08:26.167
...and the preservatives killed
the nutrients in the vegetables.

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:28.397
But, you know...

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:30.672
But...

00:08:30.843 --> 00:08:31.673
But...

00:08:32.245 --> 00:08:36.375
The food we eat and the drink
we drink become us.

00:08:42.922 --> 00:08:44.219
Yet...

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:49.128
...if those fruits and vegetables
heard the screams of the insects...

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:52.723
...even your body, Tokio,
would be filled with sadness.

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:56.864
Look...

00:08:57.069 --> 00:09:00.937
...you keep saying things like that,
but how are we supposed to live?

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:03.833
That's not hard.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.647
I mean, look at the way that old man
in the mountains was living.

00:09:07.647 --> 00:09:10.716
Vegetables grow without using
fertilizer and such.

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.583
And even without power, gas
or running water...

00:09:13.853 --> 00:09:15.445
I couldn't do that.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:21.594
The way that old man lives...

00:09:21.594 --> 00:09:24.222
...can be kind of fun and
interesting for a couple of days.

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:25.998
But it can get boring...

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:28.023
...and the novelty will wear off.

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:31.227
But...

00:09:39.378 --> 00:09:42.214
I like to watch TV and
play games.

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:44.739
I want to eat Meriken Burgers.

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:46.907
And...

00:09:48.788 --> 00:09:50.221
And?

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.016
And, well...

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.088
Well...

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.194
We're already in second year
high school, right?

00:10:00.733 --> 00:10:03.636
It's going to start getting really
busy with entrance exams...

00:10:03.636 --> 00:10:06.298
...so this is the last chance
to have fun...

00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:12.244
But, if we just leave it as it is,
the Earth will...

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:14.178
Enough of this!

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:16.949
All you talk about is the Earth!

00:10:16.949 --> 00:10:20.319
I think you're being taken in
by that Chris kid!

00:10:20.319 --> 00:10:23.089
Just look!
The city's doing just fine!

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:27.082
And whatever I might have eaten,
I'm doing just fine here!

00:10:28.761 --> 00:10:29.853
But still...

00:10:38.037 --> 00:10:41.207
Maybe you fell in love with him.

00:10:41.207 --> 00:10:41.764
Huh?

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:44.242
That Chris kid.

00:10:44.777 --> 00:10:45.402
What?!

00:10:53.552 --> 00:10:55.986
That little...?!
You've got to be kidding!

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:02.828
But I saw you and him at
the power plant like that...

00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:04.489
Th-That was...

00:11:04.797 --> 00:11:06.966
Chris gave me my life...

00:11:06.966 --> 00:11:08.968
...but he makes me fight monsters...

00:11:08.968 --> 00:11:13.072
...and always criticizes me and
asks, "Why do you kill?" and such.

00:11:13.072 --> 00:11:16.909
And he's always telling me how
foolish, stupid and dirty I am!

00:11:16.909 --> 00:11:18.044
Look, you!

00:11:18.044 --> 00:11:20.379
It's true, so you can't do
anything about it.

00:11:20.379 --> 00:11:21.547
What?

00:11:21.547 --> 00:11:23.344
Wh-What did you say?!

00:11:23.549 --> 00:11:24.208
Huh?!

00:11:26.285 --> 00:11:27.149
What the...?!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.346
Hey!

00:11:32.925 --> 00:11:33.659
Come!

00:11:33.659 --> 00:11:35.528
Wh-What is it, all of a sudden?!

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:37.663
Just come! Chris is in big trouble!

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:40.066
What?! Chris is...?!

00:11:40.066 --> 00:11:41.767
You don't have to go!

00:11:41.767 --> 00:11:43.035
Not for him!

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:44.024
Out of the way!

00:11:45.337 --> 00:11:47.907
You don't appreciate
Chris' kindness.

00:11:47.907 --> 00:11:49.775
Kindness? What?

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:50.673
Yeah, right!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.112
He's going to die, all right!

00:11:53.112 --> 00:11:53.737
What?!

00:11:54.847 --> 00:11:56.678
It's all bull, Juna. All bull.

00:11:57.016 --> 00:11:57.880
You're kidding...

00:11:59.085 --> 00:12:00.712
You're kidding...

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.627
Nourishment from
the fruits of the land.

00:12:08.627 --> 00:12:12.358
I've grown to be tasty, so
go ahead and eat me.

00:12:12.465 --> 00:12:15.923
Apples and oranges,
carrots and parsley...

00:12:16.035 --> 00:12:19.839
Tomatoes and cabbage,
watercress and green pepper...

00:12:19.839 --> 00:12:22.933
Appare! Appare!
Appare of the land!

00:12:23.375 --> 00:12:26.545
Another Appare day for me!

00:12:26.545 --> 00:12:27.739
It's delicious!

00:12:29.381 --> 00:12:33.010
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:12:40.559 --> 00:12:42.288
I'm sorry.

00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:46.031
I haven't received instructions
about allowing civilians in.

00:12:46.031 --> 00:12:47.266
This is an emergency!

00:12:47.266 --> 00:12:50.603
We need the power of
Tl-2 right now!

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:52.004
But...

00:12:52.004 --> 00:12:54.165
Well, I'll check with control.

00:12:54.707 --> 00:12:55.341
What?

00:12:55.341 --> 00:12:58.377
Open. Open. Open...

00:12:58.377 --> 00:13:00.045
The words...

00:13:00.045 --> 00:13:01.808
Open...

00:13:04.016 --> 00:13:05.847
All right. Let's go.

00:13:26.772 --> 00:13:28.069
You can take that off.

00:13:30.176 --> 00:13:32.235
What is this place?

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:36.549
These are the
Sacred Ancient Ruins...

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:39.185
...where objects and spirits mingle.

00:13:39.185 --> 00:13:40.049
Huh?

00:13:41.353 --> 00:13:44.049
Where objects and spirits mingle?

00:13:56.735 --> 00:13:57.827
Chris?

00:14:00.639 --> 00:14:01.435
Juna?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:08.738
Juna!

00:14:10.082 --> 00:14:11.684
No way...

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.812
He's really about to die...

00:14:16.655 --> 00:14:19.453
No! Doubts become reality here!

00:14:32.171 --> 00:14:34.162
Sacrificial Offering

00:14:34.673 --> 00:14:35.875
Death Illness

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:36.705
Death Illness Suffering

00:14:47.953 --> 00:14:50.046
Chris?! What on Earth...?!

00:14:51.457 --> 00:14:52.822
Tokio!

00:15:00.799 --> 00:15:03.768
Raaja! From Chris?!

00:15:06.338 --> 00:15:07.862
Dream? Amazed!
Monster! Not real?

00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:13.512
Monster!

00:15:13.512 --> 00:15:14.604
Tokio.

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:20.377
Tokio!

00:15:23.522 --> 00:15:25.353
No...

00:15:27.226 --> 00:15:28.591
No!

00:15:39.038 --> 00:15:40.005
Stop!

00:15:40.005 --> 00:15:41.340
Stop this! Or I'll shoot!

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.107
Kill

00:15:42.107 --> 00:15:43.542
Kill

00:15:43.542 --> 00:15:44.668
Why do you kill?

00:15:47.179 --> 00:15:48.441
What is this?!

00:16:11.337 --> 00:16:12.838
What was that?!

00:16:12.838 --> 00:16:14.373
Get the emergency power up!

00:16:14.373 --> 00:16:16.238
And check out the
situation immediately!

00:16:19.545 --> 00:16:21.880
The grotto down below?

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:22.815
Raaja...

00:16:22.815 --> 00:16:24.116
...And even Ashura!

00:16:24.116 --> 00:16:25.344
Activate the Protective Barrier!

00:16:25.851 --> 00:16:26.919
It's incredible!

00:16:26.919 --> 00:16:29.149
Her thoughts
are taking the form of words.

00:16:29.755 --> 00:16:31.223
The fool.

00:16:31.223 --> 00:16:33.020
She's been taken in by the words.

00:16:56.281 --> 00:16:57.543
Don't cry.

00:16:59.752 --> 00:17:01.420
Now!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.978
No!

00:17:03.922 --> 00:17:05.557
You mustn't shoot Chris!

00:17:05.557 --> 00:17:06.425
What are you talking about?!

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:09.695
He's possessed by the Raaja
and he was going to kill Tokio!

00:17:09.695 --> 00:17:10.929
That's not true!

00:17:10.929 --> 00:17:11.759
Chris is...

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:12.760
Chris is...

00:17:13.432 --> 00:17:15.334
...kind-hearted!

00:17:15.334 --> 00:17:17.063
Kind

00:17:19.371 --> 00:17:20.497
Don't cry.

00:17:31.717 --> 00:17:33.810
Who are you?

00:17:34.286 --> 00:17:35.116
An angel?

00:17:36.288 --> 00:17:39.825
Please. If you are an angel,
can you tell God that...

00:17:39.825 --> 00:17:43.852
...I don't want this power and that
I want my mom and dad back?

00:17:55.107 --> 00:17:56.506
So warm...

00:17:57.443 --> 00:18:00.207
You're so warm even though
I can't touch you.

00:18:00.412 --> 00:18:02.812
You really must be an...

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:07.519
I can't believe he's...

00:18:07.519 --> 00:18:08.918
I can't believe...

00:18:09.121 --> 00:18:10.952
...he's so kind.

00:18:35.414 --> 00:18:36.181
It can't be that...

00:18:36.181 --> 00:18:38.342
...Chris is protecting the Raaja...?

00:18:38.584 --> 00:18:40.552
Chris is kind.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.056
He felt so sorry even for
the ferocious Raaja...

00:18:44.056 --> 00:18:46.115
...that he couldn't kill it.

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:49.852
He sealed it within his own body.

00:18:50.429 --> 00:18:53.398
That's why Chris' life
has been eroding...

00:18:53.398 --> 00:18:54.833
That's crazy!

00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:55.959
Please.

00:18:56.468 --> 00:18:57.903
Please save Chris.

00:18:57.903 --> 00:18:59.962
But I can't do that.

00:19:01.974 --> 00:19:05.277
What do you mean?!
You have the power!

00:19:05.277 --> 00:19:07.412
You were even chosen by Chris!

00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:08.970
But...

00:19:09.515 --> 00:19:12.882
Please, if Chris were to die...
I... I...

00:19:13.585 --> 00:19:15.450
...I'll be all alone.

00:19:16.889 --> 00:19:18.413
Cindy...

00:19:24.296 --> 00:19:25.160
But...

00:19:25.597 --> 00:19:27.326
But how am I supposed to do it?

00:19:28.967 --> 00:19:30.161
Sickness, Death, Suffering

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.001
Sickness, Death, Suffering

00:19:34.239 --> 00:19:35.729
Sickness, Death, Suffering

00:19:36.775 --> 00:19:38.037
He still has life!

00:19:38.744 --> 00:19:40.143
All right!

00:19:44.082 --> 00:19:46.018
Stop it, Juna!

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:47.451
You'll be killed!

00:19:49.621 --> 00:19:51.089
Please, Tokio.

00:19:51.089 --> 00:19:53.557
Don't hold me back
with words.

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:57.196
My Juna

00:19:57.196 --> 00:19:59.221
My Juna

00:20:23.689 --> 00:20:25.991
Death

00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:27.754
Life

00:20:27.993 --> 00:20:29.294
The words have changed.

00:20:29.294 --> 00:20:30.693
Her thoughts?

00:21:02.828 --> 00:21:03.852
Chris...

00:21:11.503 --> 00:21:15.098
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Chris.

00:21:15.807 --> 00:21:19.004
I always misunderstood
your words.

00:21:20.412 --> 00:21:23.982
To think the reason you asked me
"Why do you fight?"...

00:21:23.982 --> 00:21:27.418
...and "Why do you kill?" was
because you'd even save Raaja.

00:21:29.454 --> 00:21:32.685
Humans are such
constrained creatures.

00:21:33.158 --> 00:21:34.626
Not only by their spoken words...

00:21:34.626 --> 00:21:37.459
...but they are also bound up
by the words in their minds.

00:21:38.397 --> 00:21:40.932
The more words that accumulate...

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.196
...the more misunderstandings there are.

00:21:43.468 --> 00:21:45.402
The words create
the misunderstandings?

00:21:46.171 --> 00:21:48.366
You still misunderstand me.

00:21:49.775 --> 00:21:55.042
I did not choose to save
the Raaja out of kindness.

00:21:55.747 --> 00:21:56.645
No...

00:21:57.849 --> 00:21:58.907
What do you mean?

00:22:21.773 --> 00:22:22.637
Juna...

00:22:27.179 --> 00:22:28.168
Thank goodness.

00:22:32.784 --> 00:22:36.021
I don't know what I would've done
if your finger...

00:22:36.021 --> 00:22:37.488
...was thicker than Sayuri's.

00:22:37.923 --> 00:22:38.719
Huh?

00:22:39.524 --> 00:22:42.857
Is that what you talked to
Sayuri about?

00:22:43.128 --> 00:22:47.121
I just never want to let go of you.

00:22:48.834 --> 00:22:50.165
Tokio...

00:23:00.979 --> 00:23:02.581
What's the matter?

00:23:02.581 --> 00:23:04.412
Just being shy?

00:23:07.352 --> 00:23:07.943
I'm sorry.

00:23:08.487 --> 00:23:09.078
Huh?

00:23:09.354 --> 00:23:10.446
I'm really sorry.

00:23:11.223 --> 00:23:14.852
I'm really happy about
how you feel about me.

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:15.889
But...

00:23:17.562 --> 00:23:18.153
...right now...

00:23:19.064 --> 00:23:20.265
So, you have feelings for...

00:23:20.265 --> 00:23:22.165
This has nothing to do with Chris!

00:23:25.303 --> 00:23:27.533
Then, then why?

00:23:28.507 --> 00:23:29.565
I...

00:23:30.041 --> 00:23:31.338
...just don't want to...

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:34.913
I just don't want to...

00:23:34.913 --> 00:23:37.905
...put you in any more danger.

00:23:46.992 --> 00:23:52.988
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:25:34.432 --> 00:25:37.068
Epilogue

00:25:37.068 --> 00:25:39.271
Epilogue

00:25:39.271 --> 00:25:40.171
Epilogue

00:25:40.171 --> 00:25:42.240
If words are misunderstood...

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:43.730
...then why?

00:25:44.109 --> 00:25:47.442
Why do people depend on words?

00:25:48.680 --> 00:25:52.717
Because words give form.

00:25:52.717 --> 00:25:53.479
Form?

00:25:54.452 --> 00:25:57.822
Words give form to
shifting feelings...

00:25:57.822 --> 00:26:01.952
...and a reality that is
hard to grasp.

00:26:03.128 --> 00:26:07.799
By combining those forms
in many different ways...

00:26:07.799 --> 00:26:11.036
...it brings together memories...

00:26:11.036 --> 00:26:15.200
...and the power to bring together
the aspirations of the future.

00:26:16.808 --> 00:26:20.312
If people had never been
acquainted with words...

00:26:20.312 --> 00:26:25.409
...we may not have been able to
think the way we do now.

00:26:25.717 --> 00:26:28.550
Words lead to thinking?

00:26:29.120 --> 00:26:31.189
However, people become...

00:26:31.189 --> 00:26:34.454
...so caught up with
the power of words...

00:26:34.793 --> 00:26:37.887
...that they give meaning
to the actual words...

00:26:38.697 --> 00:26:42.793
...and keep the past in records
over time.

00:26:43.268 --> 00:26:45.236
They forgot to live...

00:26:45.236 --> 00:26:48.399
...in the here and now, because
they became stuck on words?

00:26:48.573 --> 00:26:49.597
That's right.

00:26:50.475 --> 00:26:52.272
They forgot the now.

00:26:52.777 --> 00:26:55.541
And everything that
does not speak those words...

00:26:55.847 --> 00:27:00.682
The whispers that don't
express themselves in words...

00:27:01.152 --> 00:27:03.017
...like the birds flying high
in the sky, the animals...

00:27:03.455 --> 00:27:05.056
...the wildflowers...

00:27:05.056 --> 00:27:10.187
...forests, and the wind
that you cannot even see...

00:27:11.396 --> 00:27:13.728
...as well as the ocean.

00:27:14.966 --> 00:27:16.763
They are forgotten.

00:27:17.836 --> 00:27:21.670
Not only the whispers of the birds
and the wind are forgotten.

00:27:22.073 --> 00:27:27.212
Even among people who
speak the same words...

00:27:27.212 --> 00:27:29.442
...their feelings are scattered
all over the place.

00:27:31.750 --> 00:27:33.115
That can't be helped.

00:27:34.185 --> 00:27:37.450
The purpose of words
is to categorize.

00:27:38.056 --> 00:27:40.957
Words categorize?

00:27:41.526 --> 00:27:46.520
When I call out "Cindy" to you...

00:27:47.832 --> 00:27:52.929
...and when you whisper
"Chris" to me...

00:27:54.806 --> 00:28:03.043
...those two words actually
separate us by a greater distance.

00:28:05.216 --> 00:28:06.649
What?

00:28:08.253 --> 00:28:09.686
But still...

00:28:12.123 --> 00:28:13.784
Chris...

00:28:13.890 --> 00:28:16.229
Episode 8: The Distant Rain

00:28:16.229 --> 00:28:21.089
Episode 9: Before Birth

00:28:21.633 --> 00:28:23.430
What do you like about Juna?

00:28:23.601 --> 00:28:25.228
What is it, all of a sudden?

00:28:26.738 --> 00:28:29.605
Have you ever kissed him?

00:28:31.476 --> 00:28:33.376
Uh, of course I have.

00:28:37.582 --> 00:28:39.243
Please, don't hang up!

00:28:42.587 --> 00:28:45.385
Oh, no! I just died again.

00:28:48.159 --> 00:28:50.491
No...

00:28:50.962 --> 00:28:52.486
No... no...

00:28:54.632 --> 00:28:57.260
Mom, mom...

00:28:58.770 --> 00:28:59.964
Hold me.

00:29:01.206 --> 00:29:03.936
Hold me, hold me...

00:29:06.044 --> 00:29:08.308
Happy Birthday.

00:29:09.781 --> 00:29:13.547
When people are born
into this world...
